* Files in this folder are Merlin16 Macro library files.
* They should be copied to your Merlin16 Macro library folder.
* To find the location of your Merlin16 Macro library folder
* enter Merlin and catalog pathname "4/"
* On my system 4/ is /Bernie/Merlin16/Macro.library
* Marinetti source files rely on the macro folder being assigned to 4/
* If you have modified Merlins default paths then you will need
* to modify the source files. Please do not commit your changes into CVS.

